# Package boundaries

| Package | Owns |
| --- | --- |
| `shared` | Constants, shared types, tiny utils |
| `ai` | `AIProvider`, Gemini/mock, prompts, schemas, orchestrator |
| `memory` | Storage adapter, router, scoring, markdown format |
| `emotion-engine` | Emotion/action vocabulary, transitions |
| `character-engine` | Live2D/renderer, motions, parameter control |
| `voice` | STT, TTS, lip-sync |
| `behavior` | Observation window and response hints |
| `ui` | Reusable primitives only |

Memory depends on a `FileSystemAdapter` injected by the app. Do not import Tauri inside `packages/memory`.
New LLM backends implement `AIProvider`. Do not fork the orchestrator.
